{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40875","headline":"谢别毛仙翁 · 张爲","name":"谢别毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羸形感神药，削骨生丰肌。\n兰炷飘灵烟，妖怪立诛夷。\n重覩日月光，何报父母慈。\n黄河浊衮衮，别泪流澌澌。\n黄河清有时，别泪无收期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}